{
  "$schema": "../gen/schemas/desktop-schema.json",
  "identifier": "brain",
  "description": "Hidden brain window (ARC-2): every brain command; events: listen and emit_to only. #ui-4 (review #603): also the native MOG right-click menu (`mog-context-menu.ts`), since a MOG view may only listen and call view_emit (ARC-4).",
